title: Teardown, verified against Azure rather than an exit code
subtitle: week-13 — two of the nine resources live outside the resource group
width: 1020
---
$ bash week-13-diagnostic-settings-at-scale/scripts/cleanup.sh
removing remediation tasks...
  deleted rem-keyvault-vaults

terraform destroy...
azurerm_resource_group.diag: Destruction complete after 26s

Destroy complete! Resources: 9 destroyed.

verifying against Azure, not against the destroy's exit code
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  resource group gone                        PASS
  Log Analytics workspace gone               PASS
  subscription policy assignment gone        PASS
  remediation role assignment gone           PASS
  note: workspace soft-deleted for 14 days, name still reserved

  teardown verified.

# The policy assignment and its role assignment are at SUBSCRIPTION
# scope. Deleting the resource group leaves both behind, still trying
# to remediate into a workspace that no longer exists -- which is why
# they are asserted separately.
